<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'ORPHEUS // SUBJECT LINK' }) %>
<body class="terminal-body">
    <div class="site-shell">
        <header class="site-header shell-width">
            <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="回到 ORPHEUS 入口">
                <span class="wordmark-main">ORPHEUS</span>
                <span class="wordmark-sub">SUBJECT LINK / 02</span>
            </a>
            <div class="header-readout" aria-label="設施讀值">
                <span class="readout-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span>FACILITY NODE 07</span>
                <span class="readout-divider" aria-hidden="true">//</span>
                <span>STANDBY</span>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main id="lobby" class="lobby-shell shell-width">
            <section class="lobby-intro" aria-labelledby="lobby-title">
                <p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH FACILITY / ACCESS TERMINAL</p>
                <h1 id="lobby-title">另一端，有人。<br>你們能一起離開嗎？</h1>
                <p class="intro-copy">這座研究設施已停止運作，但 ORPHEUS 終端機仍在等待兩位受試者。建立或加入一個房間，開始交換各自看見的線索。</p>
                <div class="intro-note" role="note">
                    <span class="note-mark" aria-hidden="true">[!]</span>
                    <span>兩位玩家將分別接收不同資料。請保留房號，並透過通訊頻道協作。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="facility-diagram" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 340 220" fill="none">
                        <path d="M22 24h96v65H22zM222 24h96v65h-96zM115 142h110v58H115z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/>
                        <path d="M70 89v28h100v25M270 89v28H170" stroke="currentColor" stroke-dasharray="3 5"/>
                        <path d="M12 14h18M12 14v18M328 14h-18M328 14v18M105 210h18M105 210v-18M235 210h-18M235 210v-18" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".4"/>
                        <circle cx="70" cy="51" r="8" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="270" cy="51" r="8" stroke="#dfb974"/>
                        <circle cx="170" cy="117" r="3" fill="currentColor"/>
                        <text x="38" y="76">SUBJECT A</text><text x="238" y="76">SUBJECT B</text><text x="137" y="167">ORPHEUS</text><text x="129" y="187" font-size="8">SIGNAL ACTIVE</text>
                    </svg>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="lobby-grid" aria-label="房間操作">
                <article class="terminal-panel lobby-card role-card role-card-a" aria-labelledby="create-heading">
                    <div class="card-topline">
                        <span class="role-badge role-badge-a">玩家 A</span>
                        <span class="panel-index">01 / CREATE</span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 id="create-heading">建立研究房間</h2>
                    <p>由玩家 A 啟動一個新的 SUBJECT LINK，取得六位數房號後交給另一位玩家。</p>
                    <form method="post" action="/rooms">
                        <button class="button button-primary" type="submit">建立房間（玩家 A）<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
                    </form>
                </article>

                <article class="terminal-panel lobby-card role-card role-card-b" aria-labelledby="join-heading">
                    <div class="card-topline">
                        <span class="role-badge role-badge-b">玩家 B</span>
                        <span class="panel-index">02 / JOIN</span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 id="join-heading">加入研究房間</h2>
                    <p>輸入玩家 A 分享的房號。連線後，你會收到另一組不可見於 A 端的研究資料。</p>
                    <form method="post" action="/rooms/join">
                        <label for="roomCode">六位數房號</label>
                        <div class="input-action-row">
                            <input id="roomCode" name="roomCode" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" minlength="6" maxlength="6" required autocomplete="one-time-code" placeholder="000000">
                            <button class="button button-secondary" type="submit">加入房間（玩家 B）<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </article>
            </section>

            <section class="lobby-status-band" aria-label="系統提示">
                <span class="status-key">SYSTEM NOTE</span>
                <span>建議使用兩個獨立瀏覽器或無痕視窗。伺服器重新啟動後，房間進度會清除。</span>
            </section>
        </main>

        <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
